WEBVTT

00:02.570 --> 00:04.040
Your name is Tsav.

00:04.040 --> 00:04.950
Yes.

00:04.950 --> 00:06.110
No surname.

00:06.110 --> 00:07.950
Commonly known as "Man-Eating Ghoul."

00:07.950 --> 00:12.580
Ah, assassins raised
by the Gwen Mohsa Order are all like that.

00:12.900 --> 00:14.870
So you killed eight people in a month?

00:14.870 --> 00:16.910
You really went on a rampage, didn't you?

00:16.910 --> 00:19.390
Oh, that's not true.

00:19.390 --> 00:20.750
I'm an honest man.

00:20.750 --> 00:22.670
So I'll be honest with you.

00:23.040 --> 00:25.760
Actually, I killed 12 people.
You've got to add another 50%.

00:25.760 --> 00:27.130
- What—
- See?

00:27.130 --> 00:29.720
I'm actually honest and a people pleaser.

00:30.150 --> 00:32.930
I'm always given crappy tasks.

00:34.260 --> 00:35.930
You've killed people...

00:35.930 --> 00:38.390
Don't you feel any guilt?

00:39.160 --> 00:42.720
Excuse me,
are we discussing good and evil?

00:42.720 --> 00:46.190
I really don't get stuff like morality.

00:46.190 --> 00:47.140
Of course.

00:47.140 --> 00:50.280
It wouldn't sit right with me
to kill someone I admire.

00:50.280 --> 00:52.910
But other than that,
I don't get any of it.

00:53.240 --> 00:56.580
And the reason why my mind
wasn't affected by the Order

00:56.580 --> 01:00.000
is probably that I'm too stupid
to understand those things.

01:02.210 --> 01:04.250
I know very well how the Order operates.

01:04.750 --> 01:08.920
They use pain, drugs, happiness,
and all sorts of methods on kids to...

01:08.920 --> 01:09.780
Ah!

01:09.780 --> 01:12.810
Am I some kind of chosen one?

01:12.810 --> 01:16.130
Oh no, that's too much pressure.

01:18.070 --> 01:19.390
Aren't you scared?

01:19.390 --> 01:20.310
Hm?

01:20.700 --> 01:22.840
If you're lucky,
you'll get life imprisonment.

01:22.840 --> 01:24.290
If not, it's the death penalty.

01:24.950 --> 01:26.360
Aren't you scared?

01:26.980 --> 01:28.330
I'm terrified.

01:28.860 --> 01:31.430
But being scared won't change anything.

01:32.030 --> 01:34.740
So I want to enjoy the moment.

01:35.200 --> 01:37.410
Most people don't think like that.

01:38.330 --> 01:40.040
Do you just have no imagination?

01:40.040 --> 01:41.210
You're so mean!

01:41.210 --> 01:43.460
I got a great imagination, okay?

01:43.960 --> 01:45.250
But...

01:45.690 --> 01:47.570
I don't really understand.

01:47.570 --> 01:51.240
Is there anything more important
than the gains and losses of you

01:52.630 --> 01:54.510
and someone you admire?

01:59.850 --> 02:01.350
This is interesting.

02:02.310 --> 02:03.520
Tsav.

02:04.060 --> 02:07.000
How do you choose who to kill?

02:07.440 --> 02:08.479
No idea.

02:09.009 --> 02:11.030
I kill them if they're easy to deal with.

02:12.860 --> 02:14.510
Easy to deal with?

02:15.780 --> 02:18.370
Well, this man named Taldy

02:18.870 --> 02:25.000
disappeared from his government office
in broad daylight, in just 70 seconds.

02:25.330 --> 02:27.310
Would you call that
easy to deal with?

02:28.210 --> 02:30.820
I'm not talking about the method,
but the feeling.

02:31.340 --> 02:34.750
To me, the difficulty of killing
someone isn't much different.

02:34.750 --> 02:36.530
That's why when I have to kill...

02:37.430 --> 02:40.060
I choose someone
I won't feel heartbroken over.

02:41.370 --> 02:43.880
How do you judge that?

02:43.880 --> 02:46.880
I don't know.
It's just my intuition.

02:46.880 --> 02:49.530
It feels easy doing it.

02:50.040 --> 02:51.400
I see.

02:51.400 --> 02:53.030
Mm-hmm.

02:56.780 --> 02:58.030
This is great.

02:58.530 --> 02:59.660
Tsav.

03:01.160 --> 03:03.180
Death is too good for you.

03:03.180 --> 03:03.660
What?

03:06.770 --> 03:08.840
If there's a punishment
worse than death...

03:09.290 --> 03:10.200
That's right.

03:10.200 --> 03:12.320
I am sentencing you to be a hero.

03:12.320 --> 03:14.090
No... No, wait.

03:14.090 --> 03:15.720
Wait a minute! A hero is...

03:17.530 --> 03:19.430
Yes, that's right.

03:22.430 --> 03:25.010
You're not even allowed to die.

03:37.110 --> 03:39.990
SENTENCED TO BE A HERO

05:10.080 --> 05:11.040
See?

05:11.040 --> 05:14.060
I'm basically a pushover, aren't I?

05:14.060 --> 05:16.300
The more I investigate my target,
the more I think,

05:16.300 --> 05:19.880
"Ugh, I can't kill someone like that.
He has a wife and kids!"

05:19.880 --> 05:21.930
that kind of stuff.

05:21.930 --> 05:24.430
- That's why I've never killed my target.
- Can't believe a man like that is a hero...

05:24.430 --> 05:26.640
- But if I've got nothing to show for it,
- Still the same after dying so many times.

05:26.640 --> 05:28.560
- the Order will scold me again.
- I've heard this story dozens of times.

05:28.560 --> 05:32.330
That's why I chopped people who had
nothing to do with it and brought them back.

05:32.330 --> 05:34.020
- Aren't I the best—
- Tsav.

05:34.020 --> 05:35.520
Shut up.

05:35.520 --> 05:37.530
Ah! I'm sorry, bro.

05:37.530 --> 05:39.990
Did I talk too much again?

05:40.320 --> 05:42.700
Why don't we just gag him?

05:42.700 --> 05:45.990
If we sleep in the same room,
he'll talk all night long.

05:45.990 --> 05:48.400
I just can't keep quiet.

05:48.970 --> 05:50.250
Look, guys.

05:50.250 --> 05:52.020
Don't I have a tragic past,

05:52.020 --> 05:54.790
having undergone abusive training
in the Order?

05:54.790 --> 05:57.130
- I was locked in an underground dungeon—
- Shut up!

05:57.130 --> 05:58.460
Don't make me say it again.

05:58.460 --> 06:00.210
See? Xylo is angry.

06:00.210 --> 06:02.800
Whoa! Sorry, bro!

06:03.260 --> 06:05.180
Alright, Dotta, you apologize too.

06:05.180 --> 06:05.970
Huh?

06:05.970 --> 06:07.100
- Why do I have to apologize too?
- Sigh...

06:07.100 --> 06:09.560
That's what I hate about you.
Don't you realize that?

06:09.560 --> 06:12.350
Dotta, you should learn
to say something witty too.

06:12.350 --> 06:14.010
Alright, hurry up and apologize.

06:29.800 --> 06:31.550
They're pretty close.

06:31.550 --> 06:34.870
At this rate, they'll arrive at night.

06:37.460 --> 06:39.130
Y-Yes.

06:40.880 --> 06:41.880
So?

06:41.880 --> 06:43.880
How many Holy Knights will remain?

06:43.880 --> 06:45.510
About 50.

06:45.510 --> 06:47.560
They're all trustworthy soldiers.

06:48.050 --> 06:49.810
That's not nearly enough.

06:49.810 --> 06:53.390
Though Venetim has also recruited
prisoners from Milnid Jail...

06:53.770 --> 06:54.870
Recruited prisoners?

06:54.870 --> 06:56.000
Through bribery?

06:56.000 --> 06:56.750
Yes.

06:56.750 --> 07:00.390
He said they're all on death row,
so I can do whatever I want with them.

07:00.390 --> 07:03.240
The punishment for criminals is the same,
no matter where they are.

07:03.240 --> 07:04.700
Ah, I can see them.

07:04.700 --> 07:06.360
It could be faerie scouts.

07:06.360 --> 07:08.070
Really?

07:08.070 --> 07:09.200
Let me see.

07:09.790 --> 07:11.000
Hmm...

07:11.000 --> 07:12.410
Hmm?

07:17.230 --> 07:19.210
It looks a bit like a dog.

07:19.600 --> 07:21.420
Could it be a cir sith?

07:21.420 --> 07:23.610
He can see at this distance?

07:23.610 --> 07:26.170
His eyesight is beyond human level.

07:26.590 --> 07:28.010
Tsav, can you handle it?

07:28.550 --> 07:30.390
Well, I'll try.

07:30.680 --> 07:31.810
Even if I miss,

07:33.020 --> 07:35.520
please don't kill me.

07:35.520 --> 07:37.820
Is that the Daisy made by Verkle Corp.?

07:37.820 --> 07:38.770
Yes.

07:38.770 --> 07:41.080
It's a sniper weapon tuned by His Majesty.

07:41.780 --> 07:45.320
Ah, but are you sure? Wouldn't it
be pitiful if they had friends—

07:45.320 --> 07:47.280
Can't you shoot
without running your mouth?

07:49.850 --> 07:51.080
Roger that.

08:03.380 --> 08:05.650
How was that? Bull's-eye, right?

08:05.650 --> 08:07.550
Yeah, but there's still more.

08:07.550 --> 08:08.800
Alright, alright...

08:12.600 --> 08:14.720
- Is it okay to leave it to them?
- Another one from the back! Hurry!

08:14.720 --> 08:16.810
- Don't worry about that duo.
- All the enhancements

08:16.810 --> 08:18.440
- They can complete their missions.
- went into range and firepower.

08:18.440 --> 08:20.100
- Especially Tsav's sniping.
- Its rate of fire isn't great.

08:20.100 --> 08:22.060
- I've never seen him miss.
- Hurry up and shoot!

08:22.060 --> 08:23.360
- Alright.
- You got it.

08:23.360 --> 08:26.190
- Now we just need to set up the traps.
- I really am a genius.

08:26.190 --> 08:27.530
Yeah, here comes the next wave.

08:27.530 --> 08:29.070
- You weren't listening, were you?
- What?

08:29.070 --> 08:31.490
You're not giving up
even in this situation?

08:32.120 --> 08:35.539
There's no way I'm letting people
who'd be happy to see us dead run wild.

08:36.120 --> 08:37.140
Besides...

08:38.159 --> 08:41.000
there's still the matter of showing
how useful that person is...

08:42.590 --> 08:43.559
Over there!

08:43.559 --> 08:44.960
- Look, there's more on the side too.
- I heard you're so eager

08:44.960 --> 08:46.300
- Roger that.
- to make a name for yourself

08:46.300 --> 08:48.550
- We haven't killed them all yet.
- that you put your troops in danger.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.720
You're such a slave driver.

08:49.720 --> 08:52.600
What noble family are you from?

08:52.600 --> 08:54.240
- Yes, we're almost done.
- I'm not a noble.

08:54.240 --> 08:55.640
- I think that's it.
- No way.

08:55.640 --> 08:57.810
- Ah, here they come again.
- Would Galtuile let someone

08:57.810 --> 08:58.850
- Roger that.
- like that be a commander?

09:00.600 --> 09:01.590
Is that a faerie?

09:01.590 --> 09:03.460
Oh, you mean
under the shadow of that rock?

09:03.460 --> 09:05.440
My uncle is the High Priest.

09:05.440 --> 09:06.610
That's a faerie.

09:06.610 --> 09:08.990
That's practically
the highest rank in the Temple.

09:09.570 --> 09:11.200
No wonder I've never heard of it.

09:11.200 --> 09:13.490
Bro, it's done.

09:13.490 --> 09:15.380
Every shot hit its mark!

09:15.950 --> 09:17.870
Dotta and Tsav, stand by here.

09:18.370 --> 09:19.750
Kivia, let's go.

09:23.670 --> 09:24.960
Take it all out.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.840
We don't have enough equipment here.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.760
The Commander is leaving.

09:28.760 --> 09:30.340
Hurry up and get ready.

09:43.060 --> 09:45.210
I heard you're staying, Commander Kivia.

09:45.900 --> 09:48.610
Can't believe you want to see
the heroes die with your own eyes.

09:48.610 --> 09:50.970
While I find it a bit degrading,

09:50.970 --> 09:52.360
I'll pray for your safety.

09:54.910 --> 09:56.740
I'll pray for your safety too,

09:56.740 --> 09:58.020
Kivia.

09:58.540 --> 09:59.450
Pelmerry.

09:59.450 --> 10:00.790
Don't go too far from me.

10:01.370 --> 10:03.170
This guy is the goddess killer.

10:03.170 --> 10:04.250
You...

10:04.250 --> 10:05.710
All right, Hord.

10:05.710 --> 10:07.030
I will not leave your side.

10:07.790 --> 10:08.710
Tch.

10:09.210 --> 10:13.210
Hord, was I useful in this mission?

10:13.210 --> 10:14.340
You were perfect.

10:14.340 --> 10:15.720
There's no doubt about it.

10:16.570 --> 10:17.930
In that case...

10:18.640 --> 10:21.750
will you say, "As expected of Pelmerry"?

10:22.810 --> 10:24.140
Understood.

10:24.690 --> 10:26.010
As expected of Pelmerry.

10:30.900 --> 10:32.650
We'll take our leave now.

10:40.700 --> 10:42.630
Is that the ninth goddess?

10:42.630 --> 10:44.870
Yes, it's Lady Pelmerry.

10:44.870 --> 10:48.360
The one who made a covenant with her is
the Ninth Order Holy Knight Commander,

10:48.360 --> 10:50.460
Hord Clivios.
You know him, right?

10:50.460 --> 10:54.220
He's said to be an aristocrat
who once owned vast lands in the south.

10:54.220 --> 10:57.830
Clivios's red wine is a high-end product.

10:57.830 --> 10:58.930
However...

10:58.930 --> 11:02.330
What we have here
doesn't look like wine at all...

11:05.210 --> 11:07.440
Gosh, this is tiring.

11:07.440 --> 11:10.150
Are we going to lure
the Demon Lord into this fortress

11:10.150 --> 11:11.610
and detonate these barrels?

11:12.070 --> 11:15.150
Yes, we'll kill Iblis repeatedly
with potent poison.

11:15.150 --> 11:17.570
That means we'll die too, right?

11:18.240 --> 11:19.480
I don't like this.

11:19.990 --> 11:21.700
It's kind of pissing me off.

11:21.700 --> 11:24.460
Should I kill someone?

11:24.460 --> 11:25.620
What?

11:25.620 --> 11:27.670
Kid, what did you just say?

11:28.750 --> 11:29.750
You want to die?

11:31.590 --> 11:34.840
You lowly heroes
shouldn't get carried away—

11:34.840 --> 11:36.510
Stop it, Zofflec!

11:36.510 --> 11:37.430
Tch.

11:37.430 --> 11:38.590
I get it.

11:42.890 --> 11:45.200
Why did you make a move?

11:45.200 --> 11:47.140
To vent my anger.

11:47.140 --> 11:50.650
Bro, you kick rocks
when you're angry, don't you?

11:50.650 --> 11:52.700
Rocks are different from humans.

11:52.700 --> 11:54.990
Oh, that's human discrimination!

11:54.990 --> 11:57.110
Humans are also part of nature.

11:57.110 --> 11:59.630
Bro, I don't think it's a good idea
for you to favor them.

11:59.630 --> 12:01.580
I have found you, Xylo!

12:01.580 --> 12:03.330
Goddess!

12:03.330 --> 12:05.290
Have you been watching the house?

12:06.460 --> 12:08.020
Let us skip the small talk.

12:08.020 --> 12:10.790
More importantly, you sneaked out
without telling me, didn't you?

12:11.170 --> 12:13.250
That is not something my knight should do.

12:13.250 --> 12:14.550
Lady Teoritta.

12:14.550 --> 12:17.030
We have fulfilled our duty.

12:17.030 --> 12:18.130
Please have mercy on us.

12:18.130 --> 12:19.160
Mhm.

12:19.680 --> 12:20.720
Hmm?

12:24.920 --> 12:25.800
Xylo.

12:26.600 --> 12:29.810
You seem to have had
a fun time doing recon with Kivia.

12:29.810 --> 12:32.520
There's no such thing as "fun recon."

12:32.520 --> 12:34.490
L-Lady Teoritta!

12:34.490 --> 12:36.400
We picked these berries from the forest.

12:38.030 --> 12:39.950
They're pretty sweet.

12:42.410 --> 12:43.910
The two of you went

12:43.910 --> 12:45.240
to the forest together?

12:45.240 --> 12:46.870
To pick berries?

12:47.370 --> 12:49.250
That sounds like fun.

12:49.250 --> 12:51.130
- No, we were just
- You got a map?

12:51.130 --> 12:52.920
- fulfilling our duties.
- Yep.

12:53.290 --> 12:55.250
Xylo, my knight!

12:55.250 --> 12:57.550
- I met the Ninth Order of Holy Knights!
- Bro, here.

12:57.550 --> 12:58.380
Oh.

12:59.110 --> 12:59.930
I see.

13:01.190 --> 13:03.050
Don't you dare give me "I see"!

13:03.050 --> 13:04.560
Listen up!

13:04.560 --> 13:09.770
That goddess over there gets her head
rubbed seven times! Seven times in a day!

13:10.100 --> 13:11.350
So what?

13:11.830 --> 13:14.610
I haven't even gotten
my head rubbed once!

13:14.940 --> 13:17.110
I'm not asking you to do it seven times,

13:17.110 --> 13:18.570
but at least half of that...

13:19.320 --> 13:22.780
I haven't even gotten
my head rubbed once!

13:23.200 --> 13:24.010
Here!

13:26.250 --> 13:27.020
I see.

13:29.250 --> 13:33.210
- Ugh! Why do you not get it, my knight?
- Forget about that.

13:33.210 --> 13:34.920
- I told you to rub my head!
- At this rate,

13:34.920 --> 13:36.020
- Just rub my head!
- we'll be trampled by the faeries,

13:36.020 --> 13:37.000
and it'll all be over.

13:37.000 --> 13:37.920
Commander Kivia.

13:38.340 --> 13:40.490
Some strangers have arrived
at the back gate.

13:40.490 --> 13:42.630
They say they're here to see this man.

13:43.970 --> 13:44.790
Me?

13:47.390 --> 13:48.810
You guys...

13:49.180 --> 13:52.270
I heard something
is approaching this fortress.

13:52.690 --> 13:54.440
We're just lowly miners,

13:54.440 --> 13:56.570
but I'm sure there's something
we can do to help.

13:59.780 --> 14:00.940
Sigh...

14:01.380 --> 14:03.780
You understand our situation, don't you?

14:03.780 --> 14:06.430
You're the king and the heroes
who saved our lives.

14:06.430 --> 14:08.840
It's only natural
that we want to help you.

14:08.840 --> 14:10.000
I'm sorry.

14:10.000 --> 14:12.210
We're neither the king nor heroes.

14:12.710 --> 14:14.080
Go back to your families.

14:14.440 --> 14:16.750
It's also for our own sake.

14:17.590 --> 14:21.170
We're all from villages around here.

14:21.170 --> 14:25.140
After losing the mine,
if this fortress falls too...

14:25.140 --> 14:28.410
We'll lose our food, shelter,
and emotional support.

14:30.890 --> 14:34.060
It's not like I don't understand,
but you barely survived...

14:34.060 --> 14:36.610
You came at the perfect time, my people.

14:36.610 --> 14:38.190
- It's His Majesty!
- You are all warriors of my kingdom.

14:38.190 --> 14:39.270
- So majestic!
- You are all warriors of my kingdom.

14:39.270 --> 14:40.320
- As majestic as ever!
- You are all warriors of my kingdom.

14:40.320 --> 14:42.320
Warriors in the truest sense of the word!

14:42.690 --> 14:43.510
Your Majesty.

14:43.510 --> 14:45.240
Don't say such nonsense!

14:45.240 --> 14:47.450
What are you talking about,
Commander in Chief Xylo?

14:47.450 --> 14:50.160
We're seriously short on troops right now.

14:50.620 --> 14:52.040
I know that.

14:52.410 --> 14:53.460
But these guys...

14:53.460 --> 14:56.830
Of course, I won't ask you
to sacrifice the lives of my people.

14:56.830 --> 14:59.530
However, they can help me.

14:59.530 --> 15:00.380
What?

15:00.800 --> 15:04.390
No matter how complicated
the sacred seal engraving is,

15:04.390 --> 15:06.530
if they see my blueprint,

15:06.530 --> 15:08.470
anyone can follow it.

15:09.600 --> 15:12.180
With the strength
of my people who obey me,

15:12.180 --> 15:16.480
we can turn this fortress into
an impregnable military stronghold!

15:17.350 --> 15:18.520
And,

15:18.520 --> 15:21.530
let's claim the glory of victory together!

15:23.740 --> 15:25.240
Yes, Your Majesty!

15:25.820 --> 15:27.030
My people!

15:27.030 --> 15:29.740
Begin the work immediately.

15:29.740 --> 15:36.000
Your Majesty...

15:43.750 --> 15:44.670
Alright.

15:45.050 --> 15:47.590
Everything is going
according to plan so far.

15:48.220 --> 15:49.800
Now then, Xylo.

15:50.180 --> 15:52.060
Please explain the details of the plan.

15:52.060 --> 15:53.050
Sigh...

15:53.600 --> 15:55.810
Tatsuya, seal off the underground passage.

15:56.350 --> 15:58.750
Take about twenty Holy Knights with you.

15:58.750 --> 15:59.560
Mhm.

16:00.230 --> 16:01.520
Tsav, take the back door.

16:01.520 --> 16:03.360
If anything approaches,
blow it all away.

16:03.360 --> 16:05.150
Oh, so it's my turn, huh?

16:06.070 --> 16:07.710
By the way, where's Dotta?

16:07.710 --> 16:09.760
He has another mission.

16:10.240 --> 16:12.990
Next, the miners will stay
at the rear of the front line

16:13.450 --> 16:15.320
and support the Holy Knights from there.

16:15.320 --> 16:17.660
We've been ordered not to raise
the castle drawbridge.

16:17.660 --> 16:19.170
It's a dangerous position.

16:19.170 --> 16:22.250
There's no need to push yourself.
Just hold out for half a day.

16:22.250 --> 16:25.550
Yes, I'll continue
with the sacred seal tuning.

16:25.970 --> 16:26.970
And then?

16:26.970 --> 16:28.260
What will you do, Xylo?

16:29.890 --> 16:31.140
I'll take the initiative.

16:34.790 --> 16:36.500
I expect nothing less from my bro.

16:36.500 --> 16:37.600
Yeah.

16:38.010 --> 16:38.840
Listen up.

16:39.310 --> 16:41.790
Hold off the faerie's attack
as much as you can.

16:41.790 --> 16:44.150
I'll drag out Iblis's true form.

16:44.150 --> 16:46.630
Before it reaches this fortress,

16:46.630 --> 16:48.790
I'll use the pre-arranged traps

16:50.240 --> 16:51.240
to kill it.

16:52.030 --> 16:53.870
For everyone to survive...

16:54.370 --> 16:55.370
this is the only way.

16:56.330 --> 16:58.080
Are you kidding me?

16:58.080 --> 16:59.250
I'll kill you!

16:59.250 --> 17:00.540
Don't get carried away!

17:01.500 --> 17:04.880
Why must we obey the heroes' orders?

17:04.880 --> 17:05.619
Tell me!

17:05.619 --> 17:07.760
Aren't you all worse than humans?

17:07.760 --> 17:09.890
You goddess killer!

17:16.349 --> 17:18.810
Could you please not make my bro angry?

17:19.349 --> 17:22.190
I don't want to get caught
in the crossfire.

17:22.190 --> 17:25.050
W-Why didn't you shoot at me?

17:25.050 --> 17:26.859
What do you mean, "why"?

17:26.859 --> 17:29.780
Because you're big and energetic,

17:29.780 --> 17:32.200
you should be able to do the job properly.

17:36.540 --> 17:37.870
Bro...

17:39.740 --> 17:40.700
Tsav.

17:40.700 --> 17:43.460
I agree that this method is effective...

17:44.170 --> 17:45.300
but don't do it again.

17:50.760 --> 17:52.250
Oh, right.

17:52.250 --> 17:53.590
It's better to just kill him—

17:53.590 --> 17:54.720
Ouch!

17:54.720 --> 17:58.100
No, take him away and stop
the bleeding with a sacred seal.

18:07.190 --> 18:09.150
So, what do you want?

18:09.150 --> 18:12.320
To be honest,
I have a letter addressed to you.

18:12.950 --> 18:14.960
- It's from...
- No.

18:14.960 --> 18:16.310
Burn the letter.

18:17.410 --> 18:18.830
Uh...

18:18.830 --> 18:22.280
It's from Frenci Mastibolt.

18:22.280 --> 18:24.500
Speaking of the Mastibolt family,
if I recall...

18:24.500 --> 18:26.920
they're the night-gaunts
in the south, right?

18:26.920 --> 18:29.340
They said they would
lend us their army...

18:29.700 --> 18:35.760
Personally, I'd like to ask for their help...

18:36.490 --> 18:37.760
If possible...

18:37.760 --> 18:38.470
Eek!

18:38.930 --> 18:40.600
We're not talking about this anymore.

18:41.680 --> 18:43.810
I-I get it.

18:44.310 --> 18:47.340
It's just unfortunate to lose
those two thousand soldiers...

18:47.860 --> 18:48.520
By the way,

18:49.070 --> 18:51.110
Jayce and Rhyno couldn't make it?

18:51.110 --> 18:53.990
Jayce replied,
"I don't want to tire Nelly out."

18:53.990 --> 18:55.790
"Watch it, or I'll kill you."

18:55.790 --> 18:57.870
Rhyno didn't reply.

18:58.390 --> 19:00.330
Even though he volunteered to be a hero,

19:00.330 --> 19:01.870
he's still as eccentric as ever.

19:01.870 --> 19:03.560
What about the mercenaries?

19:03.560 --> 19:05.510
I tried to contact them.

19:05.510 --> 19:07.310
But if there's no payment...

19:07.310 --> 19:09.420
Dotta is taking care of the money.

19:09.420 --> 19:11.210
I hope he can make it in time...

19:12.800 --> 19:15.090
Okay, quickly take it inside.

19:15.640 --> 19:18.010
- Tie it tightly.
- Let's send the miners away quickly.

19:18.010 --> 19:19.890
- Ready.
- It's truly the end of the world

19:19.890 --> 19:21.640
if even they are forced to fight.

19:23.600 --> 19:25.060
The end of the world...

19:26.100 --> 19:28.150
Your Majesty, what should we do next?

19:28.150 --> 19:29.060
Xylo.

19:29.060 --> 19:31.730
- Hold it like this, I'll set the position.
- If...

19:31.730 --> 19:33.320
- Yes.
- I mean, if...

19:34.470 --> 19:38.450
If someone really wanted
to wipe out humanity...

19:38.920 --> 19:40.120
what would you do?

19:45.480 --> 19:46.460
What?

19:47.670 --> 19:50.780
Xylo, do you like conspiracy theories?

19:51.570 --> 19:53.120
Boring as hell.

19:53.120 --> 19:56.300
You know that strange article you wrote?

19:56.300 --> 19:59.510
It mentioned Demon Lord worshipers,
or coexisters...

19:59.510 --> 20:02.090
No matter how you look at it,
that's fake news, right?

20:02.090 --> 20:05.220
It's natural for you to think that way.

20:06.960 --> 20:09.350
But if there really are
Demon Lord worshipers,

20:09.350 --> 20:12.320
or a faction advocating coexistence
with the Demon Lords,

20:12.720 --> 20:16.190
trying to make humanity lose
from behind the scenes...

20:17.070 --> 20:19.030
Don't you think everything makes sense?

20:19.590 --> 20:23.240
Including this illogical battle order.

20:27.460 --> 20:29.710
If such a person truly exists...

20:30.570 --> 20:33.500
they'd be a scumbag worse than dirt.

20:48.600 --> 20:49.550
Tch.

20:49.550 --> 20:51.510
The Demon Lord is still far away...

20:52.480 --> 20:53.820
They're here, my knight.

20:54.820 --> 20:55.900
Those are coiste bodhar,

20:56.400 --> 20:58.360
the vanguard of the army.

21:00.240 --> 21:01.110
Alright.

21:01.940 --> 21:03.330
Let's begin.

21:06.450 --> 21:10.210
The survival of humanity
hangs on this battle.

21:10.210 --> 21:12.420
We must protect our homeland!

21:12.920 --> 21:15.050
Everyone, prepare for battle!

21:16.880 --> 21:17.840
That damn king...

21:18.220 --> 21:20.400
I told him to go to the rear
and provide support...

21:20.930 --> 21:24.010
This is it! Fire!

21:34.440 --> 21:36.340
Defensive barricade, activate!

21:51.580 --> 21:53.540
Well done, everyone!

21:53.540 --> 21:56.710
Your attack has severely damaged
the enemy's morale.

21:59.010 --> 22:01.340
Prepare the next volley!

22:01.840 --> 22:02.840
His Majesty.

22:02.840 --> 22:05.100
Isn't he standing too far out?

22:06.720 --> 22:09.220
Venetim. Honestly, if something
happens to His Majesty,

22:09.220 --> 22:11.310
- Here they come! Fire!
- ...this fortress is done for.

22:11.310 --> 22:13.750
- Damn it, I missed!
- I tried my best to hold him back,

22:13.750 --> 22:15.940
but he wouldn't listen to me...

22:16.730 --> 22:21.150
If your mouth isn't useful,
then what good are you?

22:21.570 --> 22:24.310
Tsav, you're often rude to me.

22:25.860 --> 22:27.330
Clear a path for the cavalry!

22:27.330 --> 22:29.620
Begin supporting Commander Kivia
and the others!

22:29.910 --> 22:30.790
Fire!

22:33.290 --> 22:34.120
Let's go,

22:34.120 --> 22:36.080
Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights!

22:36.460 --> 22:38.920
Charge!

23:02.860 --> 23:04.150
Zofflec!

23:04.150 --> 23:04.900
Roger!

23:05.280 --> 23:07.450
All forces, turn around!

23:08.580 --> 23:11.790
Disrupt them!
Don't let them get near the fortress!

23:13.500 --> 23:16.500
Kivia and the others are pretty good.

23:17.460 --> 23:18.460
Bro!

23:18.460 --> 23:19.990
What's that?

23:23.210 --> 23:25.240
That's...

23:26.340 --> 23:27.330
Yes.

23:27.330 --> 23:29.260
I've confirmed it on my end too.

23:34.810 --> 23:36.690
I don't want to believe it, but...

23:37.850 --> 23:39.690
- They're human.
- Are they human?

23:42.780 --> 23:43.530
Fire arrows!

23:43.530 --> 23:44.150
Watch out!

23:44.490 --> 23:46.110
The defensive barricade is on fire!

23:47.120 --> 23:47.700
This is bad!

23:47.700 --> 23:51.030
The sacred seal won't work like this!

23:51.030 --> 23:52.740
Retrieve the barrels! They'll ignite!

23:57.040 --> 23:58.420
The second wave is coming!

23:58.420 --> 23:59.750
There are too many of them!

23:59.750 --> 24:01.710
We can't withstand the next wave.

24:02.170 --> 24:03.340
Damn it...

24:03.340 --> 24:05.840
The front gate can't hold much longer.

24:05.840 --> 24:06.970
They're breaking through!

24:09.340 --> 24:10.950
Damn it...

24:10.950 --> 24:11.810
At this rate,

24:11.810 --> 24:12.970
- They're in!
- before the Demon Lord appears...

24:12.970 --> 24:14.680
- Put out the fire!
- before the Demon Lord appears...

24:23.590 --> 24:25.950
We'll all be wiped out!
